#: includes/WebsiteFunctions/Settings.php:322
msgid "Manage the WordPress functions and services available across the network. Most options restrict a function; the Google translation option grants a local choice. Changes apply to all websites after saving."
msgstr ""

#: includes/WebsiteFunctions/Settings.php:332
msgid "Control access through XML-RPC and the WordPress AI integration. AI functions and access to their settings page can be restricted separately."
msgstr ""

#: includes/WebsiteFunctions/Settings.php:342
msgid "Manage additional emoji rendering, supported Google Fonts integrations and access to the font management page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/WebsiteFunctions/Settings.php:352
msgid "Set comment defaults and control avatar display. Some of these settings also write local website options; switching them off does not restore earlier values."
msgstr ""

#: includes/WebsiteFunctions/Settings.php:362
msgid "Restrict website deletion and WordPress privacy tools, and control the recurring reminder to verify the administration email address."
